  "notes": "Image titled Arduino Pro Mini (DEV-11113, 16MHz / 5V). Label is the Arduino-column name (D1, A3; 'A3/D17' split), the white Name box (silkscreen) first in functions, then port/serial/PWM/interrupt boxes outward. FTDI header labels taken from the 'To target board' row; the 'To FTDI breakout' row (GND CTS VCC TXO RXI DTR) names the mating cable side and is not recorded as pin functions. PCB silkscreen BLK/GRN at the FTDI header ends kept as functions."
